# messaging's drafts (core/modules/messaging/README.md "Routes"): a member's session, drafts.read for
# the reads, drafts.write for the rest. `personId`, a person of your workspace with a lead, and
# `draftId`, the id the first request answers, go in http-client.private.env.json. The two POSTs are
# @Idempotent(): their Idempotency-Key is an example UUID; another one asks again, the same one
# answers the first answer again for a day. A write sends the cookie, so it sends Origin too.

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/messaging/leads/{personId}/drafts: asks for a draft of the lead on the channel; 202 with the draft, drafting, which the worker writes, and its maxCharacters; 404 dossier_lead_not_found
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/messaging/leads/{{personId}}/drafts
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000921

{ "channel": "linkedin_note" }

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/messaging/drafts/{id}: a draft, its kind (lead_draft or a sequence step's, outbound_step), status, plan, text and edit, generation record and gate results, and the channel's limit now, maxCharacters; 404 draft_not_found
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/messaging/drafts/{{draftId}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/messaging/leads/{personId}/drafts: the lead's drafts, newest first, each with its maxCharacters; lead drafts only, never a sequence step's
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/messaging/leads/{{personId}}/drafts
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### PATCH /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/messaging/drafts/{id}: saves the member's own text, at most the channel's limit and passing the gates (no placeholder, red line or colleague's signal); 200 with the draft, edited, and its maxCharacters; 400 draft_text_refused with details.issues, 409 draft_not_editable while it is being written, 409 step_draft_not_editable for a sequence step's draft
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/messaging/drafts/{{draftId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{ "editedText": "Hi, a short question about how your team follows up on warm leads." }

### PATCH /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/messaging/drafts/{id}, refused by a gate: a text that points at a colleague of the lead; 400 draft_text_refused, details.issues [{ "gate": "colleague_signal", "phrase": "your colleagues" }], and the draft unchanged
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/messaging/drafts/{{draftId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{ "editedText": "Hi, your colleagues liked our post about warm leads. A short question?" }

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/messaging/drafts/{id}/regenerate: asks for a new draft of the same lead and channel, unlike this one, which is kept; 202 with the new draft, drafting, and its maxCharacters; 409 step_draft_not_editable for a sequence step's draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/messaging/drafts/{{draftId}}/regenerate
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000922
